# Files excluded from `vercel deploy` (the CLI does NOT read .gitignore).
#
# Everything listed here is local runtime state or a secret and must never be
# uploaded to a deployment. Code the cloud function needs — api/, cloud/,
# src/domain/, src/cloud/, package.json — must stay out of this list.
config.json
config.json.bak-*
data/
artifacts/
cloud/data/
# Scratch space of agents and humans: it is in .gitignore, so it can never be a
# tracked file — but the upload set is built from the working tree, and a browser
# profile or a copy of a source file dropped in here must not reach a deployment
# (2026-10-12: two Chromium .db files in .local/ failed the audit).
.local/
.vercel/
.idea/
